# Composite Algorithms in the Teaching of Mathematical Methods.

**Authors:** Dupee, B., Martinez, Raquel, Tapia, Santiago

## Abstract
Describes a prototype package that uses algorithms created within the symbolic algebra system Axiom, numerical routines from the NAG Libraries together with the easy-to-use facilities of modern graphical interfaces. Considers the implementation of different techniques, both symbolic and numeric, for the analysis and calculation of interpolating functions. (Author/ASK)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ633530

